Privacy Policy – Telugu Bible

This Privacy Policy applies to the Telugu Bible app (hereafter referred to as the “Application”) for mobile devices, created by Deepak P (hereafter referred to as the “Service Provider”). This Application is provided as a free service and is intended to be used “AS IS.”

Information Collection and Use

The Application does not collect, store, or share any personally identifiable information.

It does not require or request any user permissions, such as access to:

Contacts

Location

Camera

Microphone

Device storage

The Application functions purely as a Telugu Bible reading tool, allowing users to:

Read Bible verses in Telugu

Select books and chapters

Track their reading progress

Mark completed days

Adjust font size for better readability

All features operate without any form of data collection. Any reading progress or preferences are stored locally on the user’s device only.

Children’s Privacy

The Application does not knowingly collect any information from children under the age of 13.

Since no user data is collected at all, the Application is safe for users of all age groups.

Data Security

As the Application does not collect or transmit personal data, there are no risks of data misuse, storage, or breaches from the Application itself.

The Service Provider values user privacy and ensures that the Application operates offline, except for essential services such as advertisement display (if enabled via Google AdMob).

